  function bpoWorkbench(stream){const s=streamDef(stream);if(!s)return '';const d=data(),m=currentMilestone(),tasks=(d.tasks||[]).filter(t=>(t.stream||t.l1)===stream),open=tasks.filter(isOpenTask),blk=open.filter(t=>t.status==='Blocked'),over=open.filter(isOverdue),findings=[...(d.painPoints||[]),...(d.opportunities||[])].filter(x=>x.stream===stream||x.stream==='ALL'),req=(d.requirements||[]).filter(x=>x.stream===stream),dec=(d.decisions||[]).filter(x=>x.stream===stream&&!['Closed','Decided'].includes(x.status)),tests=scopedRaw('testScenarios').filter(x=>x.stream===stream),cap=ownerCapacity(s.bpo),gate=streamGateReadiness(stream,m),br=businessReadiness(stream),next=open.filter(t=>(t.forecastDue||t.due)).sort((a,b)=>String(a.forecastDue||a.due).localeCompare(String(b.forecastDue||b.due))).slice(0,6);
    return `<div class="v9-bpo-workbench"><div class="v9-bpo-head"><div><span>${tr('BPO WORKSPACE','ESPACE BPO')}</span><h2>${esc(s.bpo||'TBD')}</h2><small>${esc(stream)} · ${esc(s.name)}</small></div><div><b>${Math.round(gate)}%</b><span>${tr('current gate task progress','avancement des tâches du jalon')}</span></div><div><b>${Math.round(br.score)}%</b><span>${tr('business readiness','préparation opérationnelle')}</span></div></div><div class="v9-bpo-kpis"><div><b>${open.length}</b><span>${tr('open tasks','tâches ouvertes')}</span></div><div><b>${blk.length}</b><span>${tr('blocked','bloquées')}</span></div><div><b>${over.length}</b><span>${tr('overdue','en retard')}</span></div><div><b>${findings.length}</b><span>${tr('findings','constats')}</span></div><div><b>${req.length}</b><span>${tr('requirements','exigences')}</span></div><div><b>${dec.length}</b><span>${tr('decisions','décisions')}</span></div><div><b>${tests.length}</b><span>${tr('tests','tests')}</span></div><div><b>${cap.unestimated?`${cap.unestimated}`:(cap.hours?`${Math.round(cap.load)}%`:'—')}</b><span>${cap.unestimated?tr('tasks need hour estimate','tâches à estimer'):tr('capacity load','charge capacité')}</span></div></div><div class="grid two-col"><div class="card pad"><h3>${tr('Traceability chain','Chaîne de traçabilité')}</h3>${traceabilityFunnel(stream)}</div><div class="card pad"><h3>${tr('Next actions','Prochaines actions')}</h3>${next.map(t=>`<button class="inbox-row" data-edit-task="${esc(t.id)}"><b>${esc(t.title)}</b><small>${esc(t.forecastDue||t.due)} · ${esc(t.status)}${t.entityScope?' · '+esc(t.entityScope):''}</small></button>`).join('')||`<div class="empty mini">${tr('No dated open tasks.','Aucune tâche ouverte datée.')}</div>`}</div></div></div>`}
